  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aldreda Fields Open-Access Aerial Fiber Network, through S2 Associates International LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA grant funds a feasibility study for the Nigerian telecommunications infrastructure developer Aldreda Fields Ltd to develop an open-access aerial wholesale fiber to the premises network in Lagos, Nigeria. This Study is expected to provide the necessary technical, economic, regulatory, and financial analysis needed to develop the architecture for an open-access network that would provide access for retail internet service providers to extend their internet connectivity services to residential and commercial clusters in Lagos, Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
